<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en-US'><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><script>window['ec:pageId']='667965188765525026'</script><title>CFP</title><link href="/images/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/jpeg"/><link href="/css/cool.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/cfp/classic.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/menu_cfp.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/js/easy.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=545"></script><script>EC.version='545'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">ICCCBDA 2027: 2027 the 12th International Conference on Cloud Computing and Big Data Analytics</div><div id="cfpvenue">Tibet Hotel, Chengdu</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Chengdu, China, April 23-25, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://www.icccbda.com/" target="_blank">https://www.icccbda.com/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icccbda2027" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icccbda2027</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>December 5, 2026</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=4252537" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_violet bg_seagreenlight">big data technologies</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=401" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_navy bg_darkyellow">machine learning</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=60556" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_bluelight bg_green">data analytics</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=43594701" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_navy bg_yellow">cloud computing fundamentals</span></a></div><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">2027 the 12th International Conference on Cloud Computing and Big Data Analytics (ICCCBDA) will be held in Chengdu, China, between 23-25 April 2027. Several current and upcoming frontier technologies, innovative solutions, research results, as well as enterprises related to cloud computing and big data analytics and their applications will be presented.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">ICCCBDA 2027 is co-sponsored by Sichuan Institute of Electronics and IEEE; co-hosted by Southwest Jiaotong University, Xihua University, and University of Electronic Science and Technology of China; hosted by Youth Talent Work Committee, Sichuan Institute of Electronics; Patrons: Key Lab of Cloud Computing &amp; Intelligent Technology.</span></span></p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Paper submissions should be in English and limited to a maximum of ten (10) pages, in the 2-column format, including all the possible appendices.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">All submissions will be reviewed by the Program Committee on the basis of technical quality, relevance to scope of the conference, originality, significance, and clarity. The following sections give further information for authors. You can find more formatting template instruction via <a href="https://www.icccbda.com/instruct8.5x11x2.doc" target="_blank">THIS LINK</a>.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Accepted papers will be published in the conference proceedings. All manuscripts are submitted as full papers and are reviewed based on their scientific merit. The reviewing process is confidential. All paper submissions will be carefully reviewed by TPC experts and reviews will be returned to the author(s) with comments to ensure the high quality of the accepted papers. The accepted papers must be revised, taking into consideration the referees' comments and suggestions, before inclusion in the conference proceedings.</span></span></p><h2>List of Topics</h2><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Deployment Models</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Service Architectures</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud System Design</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Simulation Tools</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Middleware Frameworks</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Cost Economics</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Operation Management</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Performance Optimization</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Solution Patterns</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Semantic Web</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Solution Design Patterns</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">loud Security Challenges</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Big Data Privacy Protection</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">IoT Cloud Security</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Data Governance Compliance</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Privacy-Preserving Analytics</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Blockchain Iot Data</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Collaborative Threat Detection</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Cloud Data Encryption</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">...</span></span></li></ul><h2>Committees</h2><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">International Advisory Committee</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">En-Bing Lin,Central Michigan University, USA</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Rajkumar Buyya,The University of Melbourne, Australia</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Nirwan Ansari,New Jersey Institute of Technology, USA</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yuhui Shi,Southern University of Science and Technology, China</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Hui Liu,Central South University, China</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Dong-Her Shih,National Yunlin University of Science and Technology</span></span></li></ul><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">General Conference Chairs</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Tianrui Li,Southwest Jiaotong University, China</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Zhu Han,University of Houston, USA</span></span></li></ul><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Conference Co-Chairs</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Hai Jin,Huazhong University of Science and Technology, China (IEEE Fellow, CCF Fellow, Changjiang Distinguished Professor)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Guoyin Wang,President, Chongqing Normal University, China</span></span></li></ul><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Technical Program Chairs</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xianhua Niu,Xihua University, China</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yunbo Rao,University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">William Wei Song,Dalarna University, Sweden</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yoshifumi Manabe,Kogakuin University, Japan</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Jinwei Liu,Florida A&amp;M University, USA</span></span></li></ul><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Technical Program Vice-chair</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Jianhong Zhou,Xihua University, China</span></span></li></ul><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Publication Co-Chair</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Qing Tan,Athabasca University, Canada</span></span></li></ul><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Local Chairs</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xiaoliang Chen,Xihua University, China</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Jie Hu,Southwest Jiaotong University, China</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Ling Xiong,Xihua University, China</span></span></li></ul><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Publicity Co-Chairs</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Shengke Zeng,Xihua University, China</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Chao Qi,Xihua University, China</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Fengmao Lv,Southwest Jiaotong University, China</span></span></li></ul><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Executive Secretary General</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yingqiao Pu,Sichuan Institute of Electronics, China</span></span></li></ul><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Press Coordinator</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Guoqing Deng,Sichuan Institute of Electronics, China</span></span></li></ul><h2>Publication</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Submitted papers will be peer reviewed by conference committees, and accepted papers will be included in ICCCBDA 2027 Conference Proceedings.</span></span></p><h2>Venue</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Tibet Hotel, Chengdu</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">North Renmin Road, Chengdu, Sichuan, China</span></span></p><h2>Contact</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Ms. Lesley Lei</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Mobile: 13277777770 / 18010667294</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Email for Conference Communication: icccbda@young.ac.cn</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Email for Secretary Contact: icccbda_conf@outlook.com</span></span></p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
